# Iron Man, Master of Machines: "if an artifact entered the battlefield under your control this turn" is judged by whom the
# artifact entered under (CR 603.4, 110.2), not by who controls it now. Turn 1 Bot1 casts four Moxen and Iron Man. Turn 3 he
# casts Mox Emerald, then Harmless Offering gives it to Bot2: it entered under his control this turn though he no longer
# controls it, so Iron Man draws when he attacks (hand 2, from 1 before the draw).

